  "fullDescription": "Add a spooky twist to your holiday season with our Creepy Kawaii Christmas Coloring Pages! This unique collection combines the adorable charm of kawaii with a creepy, quirky Christmas vibe. Featuring cute yet spooky characters like sinister snowmen, mischievous elves, haunted gingerbread houses, and eerie presents, these pages offer a fun and unconventional take on Christmas for those who love a bit of the unusual.\n\nTHIS INTERIOR DOWNLOAD DETAILS:\n🎅 140 CREEPY KAWAII CHRISTMAS COLORING PAGES\n🎅 NO REPEATED IMAGES\n🎅 JPG | PNG | PDF\n🎅 140 JPG FILE (PRINT READY)\n🎅 140 PNG FILE (PRINT READY)\n🎅 01 PDF FILE (PRINT READY)\n🎅 30 BOOK COVER IMAGES (300 DPI)\n🎅 SINGLE-SIDED PAGES\n🎅 SIZE 8.5″ X 11″ INCH\n🎅 ALL IMAGES IS VERY GOOD\n🎅 HIGH-QUALITY 300 DPI IMAGES FILE\n\nBook Cover Details:\n🎅 30 PNG file ( 300 dpi )\n🎅 You can resize when you design\n\nPerfect for anyone who enjoys blending cuteness with the macabre, these coloring pages provide a creative and fun way to celebrate the holidays with a twist. Dive into the world of creepy cute Christmas with these playful and slightly eerie illustrations that bring the magic and mystery of the season to life!\n\nTags/Keywords: Creepy kawaii Christmas coloring pages, spooky holiday coloring book, cute yet creepy Christmas designs, kawaii Christmas with a twist, creepy cute Christmas, Christmas snowmen and haunted gingerbread, quirky holiday coloring, fun and eerie Christmas coloring book, kawaii macabre art, unconventional Christmas fun",
